WEBVTT

00:00:01.240 --> 00:00:03.520
Research software metadata is written once,

00:00:03.520 --> 00:00:05.000
but is then left to rot.

00:00:06.860 --> 00:00:09.700
We checked 1,500 repositories.

00:00:09.860 --> 00:00:13.500
Almost a third declare a version
that isn't their latest release.

00:00:15.860 --> 00:00:20.460
From those errors, we built a public catalogue
of 29 common pitfalls,

00:00:20.580 --> 00:00:22.800
each with an example and a fix.

00:00:25.880 --> 00:00:29.140
Our open-source tools run these checks
on every change

00:00:29.140 --> 00:00:31.400
and tell maintainers what to fix.

00:00:34.660 --> 00:00:37.100
Nine in ten flagged issues are real,

00:00:37.220 --> 00:00:41.900
and registries such as the ESCAPE OSSR
can now check metadata quality.

00:00:45.040 --> 00:00:50.600
Find out more about our work
at w3id.org/codemetasoft.
